(7581350, 1217565, 35545, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot going on in this picture: the sculptural shapes and shadowy figures in the foreground, the mysterious path going down to the water, light refletions in the water, the futuristic building in the background...  I found myself ignoring the sky completely.  I really liked the picture but IMNSHO it wasn''t the best for a night sky challenge.</td>', 'There''s a lot going on in this picture: the sculptural shapes and shadowy figures in the foreground, the mysterious path going down to the water, light refletions in the water, the futuristic building in the background...  I found myself ignoring the sky completely.  I really liked the picture but IMNSHO it wasn''t the best for a night sky challenge.', '2018-07-12 14:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
